# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# HURMO UZ DASHBOARD — Frontend Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY NOTICE:
# Only NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables belong in the frontend.
# All secrets (API keys, passwords, DB credentials) must be in the BACKEND.
# Never add GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY, JWT_SECRET, etc. here.
#
# ── BACKEND CONNECTION ───────────────────────────────────────────
# URL of the deployed backend (Railway or local dev)
NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=""

# Todoist, Telegram and Google OAuth secrets belong in the backend Railway
# variables and must never be exposed through NEXT_PUBLIC_*.
